OL,3,AAttempted murder charge over councillor
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fmurder after a Bradford councillor was
OL,8,Fseriously injured in a stabbing.
OL,10,FCouncillor Ibrar Ali was attacked at
OL,11,Fabout 11:00 GMT on Thursday on
OL,12,FThornbury Avenue, before being driven
OL,13,Fto nearby Manse Street, according to
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire Police.
OL,16,FArfan Ali, 32, of Thornbury Avenue, is
OL,17,Falso charged with assault and
OL,18,Fpossession of an offensive weapon in a
OL,19,Fpublic place. He is due to appear
OL,20,Fbefore Leeds magistrates later.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
