OL,3,AZelensky says Putin is a 'killer' after
OL,4,ATrump calls Russian leader a friend
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian attacks continued overnight,
OL,7,Fwith two people killed, including a
OL,8,Fboy, and 52 injured in missile and
OL,9,Fdrone strikes on Zelensky's hometown of
OL,10,FKryvyi Rih in the central
OL,11,FDnipropetrovsk region, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
